    "summary": "Repeated account lockouts on E6401 (Isaac Nwosu). Password was reset 2026-10-27 16:05. On 2026-10-28, five failed sign-ins from iPad TB-6401 (Mail app, a personal/kids' device the employee says has work email on it) at 09:48-09:52, all with the old password. The iPad session was revoked at about 10:00 and the account unlocked. The account locked again shortly after, when the employee signed in via the chat app on their phone; the sign-in log shows no phone failures, so the source is unexplained. Employee signed in fine on the laptop. Employee is not signing in on the iPad until it is checked. Please review for possible unauthorized use or a saved-credential source."
