   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed this to Security on-call (reference SEC-500). They'll respond within an hour. I included the iPad, the lockouts, and the phone lockout that has no matching failure in the logs.\n\nUntil they've looked at it:\n- **Don't sign in on the iPad.** Leave it alone until Security has checked it.\n- **Check the phone.** Look at the Mail app and any other app that might have your work password saved.\n- **Use your laptop** for work. It's signing in fine.\n\nIf the account locks again, message me right away and I'll unlock it and add the details to SEC-500. If you notice anything odd on the iPad, like accounts or apps you don't recognize, include that too."
